        <mxCell id="note" value="Folds: crc32(S1 id) mod 10. Folds 0–3 train the bi-encoder and the cross-encoders, 4–9 stages 1–2 (validation on 8–9, US and India). A distractor (a record with no match) is put in the fold of the S1 it imitates. No external data or services; models MIT / Apache-2.0, ≤ 8B parameters." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontColor=#212529;fontColor=#495057;" vertex="1" parent="1">
